   "label": "Exam Question: Image in Bytes",
   "type": "short-answer-validation",
   "validatorId": "y10-13l2-exam-image-1",
   "validatorKey": "y10_1_3_l2_exam_image_1",
   "content": "<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Exam Question: Image in Bytes</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">Cambridge IGCSE 0478/11, June 2022, Question 5. An image is stored on a computer. The image is 16-bit colour and is 100 pixels high and 150 pixels wide.</p><div class=\"lesson-exam-card\"><div class=\"lesson-do-now-responses\"><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y10-13l2-exam-image-1-a\">Calculate the file size of the image in bytes. [3]</label><input id=\"y10-13l2-exam-image-1-a\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"exam-image-1-a\" aria-label=\"Exam Question: Image in Bytes part a\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"donow-btn\" id=\"y10-13l2-exam-image-1-check\">Check answers</button><strong>Total: 3 marks</strong></div><div id=\"y10-13l2-exam-image-1-feedback\" class=\"pseudocode-feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div>"
  },
  {
   "id": "exam-image-2",
   "label": "Exam Question: Colour Depth in Bytes",
   "type": "short-answer-validation",
   "validatorId": "y10-13l2-exam-image-2",
   "validatorKey": "y10_1_3_l2_exam_image_2",
   "content": "<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Exam Question: Colour Depth in Bytes</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">Cambridge IGCSE 0478/12, March 2023, Question 4(b). One of the images has a resolution of 1000 &times; 1000 and a colour depth of 2 bytes.</p><div class=\"lesson-exam-card\"><div class=\"lesson-do-now-responses\"><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y10-13l2-exam-image-2-a\">Calculate the file size of the image. Give your answer in bytes. [2]</label><input id=\"y10-13l2-exam-image-2-a\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"exam-image-2-a\" aria-label=\"Exam Question: Colour Depth in Bytes part a\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"donow-btn\" id=\"y10-13l2-exam-image-2-check\">Check answers</button><strong>Total: 2 marks</strong></div><div id=\"y10-13l2-exam-image-2-feedback\" class=\"pseudocode-feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div>"
